# ratum-prime.key is written to the working directory when ratum-prime runs without --data-dir
# or --key; shares.redb is the ledger's name inside --data-dir, listed for a data directory set
# to the working directory (with neither --data-dir nor --ledger no ledger file is written).
# gateway.feeramp is the gateway's fee ramp state, written to the working directory while
# datum.gateway_fee_ramp_max_bps is set and datum.gateway_fee_ramp_state_file is empty.
# Runtime state, never committed.
/ratum-prime.key
/shares.redb
